b=s?"Mek\xe2n adlar\u0131, kategorileri ve adresleri Overture Maps Places verisinden gelir ve YuMapAI taraf\u0131ndan d\xf6n\xfc\u015ft\xfcr\xfclm\xfc\u015ft\xfcr. Veri CDLA-Permissive-2.0 ile, Overture yaz\u0131l\u0131m ve \u015fema bile\u015fenleri Apache-2.0 ile lisansl\u0131d\u0131r; iki metin de a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da tam olarak yer al\u0131r.":"Place names, categories and addresses come from Overture Maps Places data, transformed by YuMapAI. The data is licensed under CDLA-Permissive-2.0 and Overture software and schema components under Apache-2.0; both texts are reproduced in full below."
r=A.e([new A.b5("CDLA-Permissive-2.0",u.aF),B.aSr],t.Wy)
q=s?"Baz\u0131 mek\xe2nlar\u0131n T\xfcrk\xe7e adlar\u0131, \xf6nem bilgisi ve ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 Wikidata'dan gelir. Wikidata yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f verisi CC0 1.0 (kamu mal\u0131 adama) alt\u0131ndad\u0131r: creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/":"Some places' Turkish names, importance and links come from Wikidata. Wikidata structured data is available under CC0 1.0 (public domain dedication): creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"
p=s?"CC BY \xb7 CC BY-SA \xb7 CC0 \xb7 kamu mal\u0131 (foto\u011frafa g\xf6re)":"CC BY \xb7 CC BY-SA \xb7 CC0 \xb7 public domain (per photo)"
o=s?"Her foto\u011fraf\u0131n yazar\u0131 ve lisans\u0131 foto\u011fraf\u0131n alt\u0131nda yaz\u0131l\u0131r":"Each photo's author and licence are shown under the photo"
n=s?'Mek\xe2n foto\u011fraflar\u0131 Wikimedia Commons\'tan, yaln\u0131z ticari kullan\u0131ma ve yeniden da\u011f\u0131t\u0131ma izin veren lisanslarla al\u0131n\u0131r. H\u0131zl\u0131 a\xe7\u0131lmas\u0131 i\xe7in k\xfc\xe7\xfclt\xfclm\xfc\u015f kopyalar\u0131 YuMapAI sunucusunda tutulur; her foto\u011fraf\u0131n kart\u0131nda "Foto: yazar \xb7 lisans" atf\u0131 ve kaynak sayfas\u0131 ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 g\xf6sterilir.':'Place photos come from Wikimedia Commons, only under licences that allow commercial use and redistribution. Resized copies are kept on the YuMapAI server so they load quickly; each photo\'s card shows the "Photo: author \xb7 licence" credit and a link to its source page.'
